No adult entertainment establishment shall be located within the following distances:
(1) 500 feet of any single or multifamily residence or 500 feet of any parcel of land which is zoned for single or multifamily uses or purposes;
(2) 500 feet of a church, school, governmentally-owned or operated building, library, civic center, public park, hospital, nursing homes or community club;
(3) 1,000 feet of another adult entertainment establishment;
(4) 1,000 feet of an establishment selling alcoholic beverages.
